        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.25,
        "phon_examples": "临/灵",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "根据《灵龟仙志》里记载。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 6.843,
      "end": 10.181,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "横山村有着深厚的文化底蕴。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0813,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0656,
        "sc_delta": 0.0156,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "横山村有着深厚的文化底蕴。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 10.311,
      "end": 14.179,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "清代中期，横山村达到了全盛时期，",
      "score": 0.0327,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0088,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0104,
        "sc_delta": -0.0017,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.071,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "清代中期，横山城达到了全盛时期。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 14.179,
      "end": 17.163,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "当时全村有两百多户，",
      "score": 0.4542,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.4243,
        "sc_logprob": -1.3011,
        "sc_delta": 0.1232,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.678,
        "seg_cer": 0.222,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "当时啊，全城有两百多户。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 17.163,
      "end": 22.925,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "一共有两三千人。陈氏家族当中屡有科考高中者，",
      "score": 0.1539,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1274,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1563,
        "sc_delta": -0.029,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.2,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.25,
        "phon_examples": "陈/城",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "一共有两三千人，城市家族当中，旅游科考高中者。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 22.925,
      "end": 27.85,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "陈氏一族在历史上是创造了不少宝贵的人文遗产，",
      "score": 0.1496,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0716,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0743,
        "sc_delta": -0.0027,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.19,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.25,
        "phon_examples": "陈/城",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "城市遗作在历史上是创造了不少宝贵的人文遗产。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 27.962,
      "end": 31.535,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "比如石刻、墓碑等等人文景观。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0159,
        "sc_logprob": -0.017,
        "sc_delta": -0.0011,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "比如，石刻、墓碑等等，人文景观。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 32.599,
      "end": 39.771,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "横山村有关陈氏的石刻主要分布在陈氏宗祠以及宗祠后面的山上。",
      "score": 0.2469,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0431,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0353,
        "sc_delta": 0.0078,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.321,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.444,
        "phon_examples": "宗/中 宗/中 陈/城 陈/城",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "横山称，有关城市的石刻主要分布在城市中心以及中心后面的山上。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 41.262,
      "end": 47.505,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "这个山怎么山？我们我们都是山峰的峰山的土名字，是我们这里的土名字。",
      "score": 0.2914,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.799,
        "sc_logprob": -0.7987,
        "sc_delta": 0.0003,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.253,
        "seg_cer": 0.633,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这个山还是没山。风风就是山风的风，风山的透明，就是我们称的透明。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 48.028,
      "end": 51.336,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "以前呢，都乾隆皇帝封他一个号的，",
      "score": 0.1053,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0176,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0183,
        "sc_delta": -0.0007,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.143,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "咧",
        "text_free": "以前咧，都乾隆皇帝封他一个号咧。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 51.336,
      "end": 54.216,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "有个一品峰。啊啊！",
      "score": 0.6504,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.8136,
        "sc_logprob": -1.9041,
        "sc_delta": -0.0905,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.943,
        "seg_cer": 0.429,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "有个一平方啊。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 54.522,
      "end": 57.3,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "看啥？一品峰？对。",
      "score": 0.68,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -4.0128,
        "sc_logprob": -3.9424,
        "sc_delta": 0.0703,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 1.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "我三，你也不得了的。跟我对。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 57.3,
      "end": 60.102,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "跟我对了我们那个宗祠啊，那也不错。",
      "score": 0.7217,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -2.1258,
        "sc_logprob": -2.0703,
        "sc_delta": 0.0555,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.6,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.167,
        "phon_examples": "宗/中",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "回到我们那个中词啊，对，不说。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 60.102,
      "end": 63.575,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "这是宗后面，宗后面。呃，",
      "score": 0.68,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -2.8307,
        "sc_logprob": -2.9267,
        "sc_delta": -0.0959,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.778,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "粽子后面，粽子后面，粽子。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 63.575,
      "end": 68.733,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "就是有靠山。宗祠里的石刻碑文，我们暂且不提。",
      "score": 0.1957,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0189,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0233,
        "sc_delta": -0.0044,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.368,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.143,
        "phon_examples": "石/四",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这是有靠山。总之，六里四克碑文，我们暂且不提。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 69.044,
      "end": 73.306,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "在进陈氏宗祠之前，我们就看到有两块碑，",
      "score": 0.164,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0015,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0013,
        "sc_delta": 0.0002,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.176,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.333,
        "phon_examples": "陈/城",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "在进城市总祠之前，我们就看到有两块碑。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 73.306,
      "end": 75.819,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "一块保存完好，字迹清晰；",
      "score": 0.1371,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0562,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0719,
        "sc_delta": -0.0158,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.3,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "一块保存完好，自己清洗。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 75.819,
      "end": 81.796,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "另外一块是断碑。陈明门把碎裂的石碑拼凑在了一起。",
      "score": 0.1457,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0049,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0045,
        "sc_delta": 0.0004,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.136,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.333,
        "phon_examples": "明/民",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "另外一块是断碑，村民们把碎裂的石碑拼凑在了一起。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 91.187,
      "end": 97.918,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "陈明门开始讲，保存完好的那块碑是陈洪谋的孙子陈兰生的告封碑。",
      "score": 0.1931,
      "wav": "",
