        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "嘞",
        "text_free": "为什么喊电视馆嘞？它是咱这。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 152.498,
      "end": 159.725,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "怎么？有时人和乾隆皇帝在下到下棋，都是讲他经常在旁边吵嘛。",
      "score": 0.1407,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2026,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2128,
        "sc_delta": -0.0103,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.308,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那陈红宝有时和乾隆皇帝在下到象棋，都是讲他紧在旁边吵嘛。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 159.725,
      "end": 164.492,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "他小把爷，脸大，两山两山的一个，两山可能也超过三十的。",
