        "seg_cer": 0.538,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "我也搞不清楚，反正他也，哎，下了七万。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 176.05,
      "end": 180.473,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "他经常吵，吵他不是讲。我他他想要什么就给他嘛，",
