      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.8401,
        "sc_logprob": -0.8021,
        "sc_delta": 0.038,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.281,
        "seg_cer": 0.591,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "就没那吃的。他那，房地产那种目光啊，他要骑马过来，到这下马的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "start": 297.87,
      "end": 301.89,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "嗯，他因为那原来那马好高啊，你不会骑那牛还是马？",
      "score": 0.16,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1813,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2157,
        "sc_delta": -0.0344,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.476,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "他以为你远了，那马好高啊！你不会用那用啥子嘛？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "start": 301.89,
      "end": 305.037,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "他就在下马台。我们下都是进祠堂。",
      "score": 0.5747,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.5996,
        "sc_logprob": -1.6803,
        "sc_delta": -0.0807,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.797,
        "seg_cer": 1.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "他们这些瞎茅台，他妈这些瞎那种金瓷的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "start": 305.07,
      "end": 310.194,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "是不是？你别讲，我从那边走过那边下，走过这个了，",
